dd a set · phone · light"}, "Weights-add-phone-dark.dc.html": {"x": 1490, "y": 3980, "w": 390, "h": 844, "title": "6 · Add a set · phone · dark"}, "Weights-range-phone-light.dc.html": {"x": 2040, "y": 3980, "w": 390, "h": 860, "title": "7 · Edit set: range · phone · light"}, "Weights-range-phone-dark.dc.html": {"x": 2510, "y": 3980, "w": 390, "h": 860, "title": "7 · Edit set: range · phone · dark"}, "Weights-pick-phone-light.dc.html": {"x": 3060, "y": 3980, "w": 390, "h": 860, "title": "8 · Edit set: picked · phone · light"}, "Weights-pick-phone-dark.dc.html": {"x": 3530, "y": 3980, "w": 390, "h": 860, "title": "8 · Edit set: picked · phone · dark"}, "Weights-sets-desktop-light.dc.html": {"x": 0, "y": 5300, "w": 1280, "h": 844, "expand": "fill", "title": "5 · Weight sets · desktop · light"}, "Weights-sets-desktop-dark.dc.html": {"x": 1360, "y": 5300, "w": 1280, "h": 844, "expand": "fill", "title": "5 · Weight sets · desktop · dark"}, "Weights-add-desktop-light.dc.html": {"x": 2720, "y": 5300, "w": 1280, "h": 844, "expand": "fill", "title": "6 · Add a set · desktop · light"}, "Weights-add-desktop-dark.dc.html": {"x": 4080, "y": 5300, "w": 1280, "h": 844, "expand": "fill", "title": "6 · Add a set · desktop · dark"}, "Weights-range-desktop-light.dc.html": {"x": 5440, "y": 5300, "w": 1280, "h": 860, "expand": "fill", "title": "7 · Edit set: range · desktop · light"}, "Weights-range-desktop-dark.dc.html": {"x": 6800, "y": 5300, "w": 1280, "h": 860, "expand": "fill", "title": "7 · Edit set: range · desktop · dark"}, "Weights-pick-desktop-light.dc.html": {"x": 8160, "y": 5300, "w": 1280, "h": 860, "expand": "fill", "title": "8 · Edit set: picked · desktop · light"}, "Weights-pick-desktop-dark.dc.html": {"x": 9520, "y": 5300, "w": 1280, "h": 860, "expand": "fill", "title": "8 · Edit set: picked · desktop · dark"}}, "order": ["Main.dc.html", "Settings-phone-dark.dc.html", "Empty-phone-light.dc.html", "Empty-phone-dark.dc.html", "Error-phone-light.dc.html", "Error-phone-dark.dc.html", "Settings-desktop-light.dc.html", "Settings-desktop-dark.dc.html", "Home-header-phone-light.dc.html", "Home-header-phone-dark.dc.html", "Home-header-desktop-light.dc.html", "Home-header-desktop-dark.dc.html", "Weights-sets-phone-light.dc.html", "Weights-sets-phone-dark.dc.html", "Weights-add-phone-light.dc.html", "Weights-add-phone-dark.dc.html", "Weights-range-phone-light.dc.html", "Weights-range-phone-dark.dc.html", "Weights-pick-phone-light.dc.html", "Weights-pick-phone-dark.dc.html", "Weights-sets-desktop-light.dc.html", "Weights-sets-desktop-dark.dc.html", "Weights-add-desktop-light.dc.html", "Weights-add-desktop-dark.dc.html", "Weights-range-desktop-light.dc.html", "Weights-range-desktop-dark.dc.html", "Weights-pick-desktop-light.dc.html", "Weights-pick-desktop-dark.dc.html"], "notes": {"t1": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "/settings on phone: list, nothing selected, save failed", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2900}, "t2": {"x": 0, "y": 1440, "text": "/settings on desktop", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2640}, "t3": {"x": 0, "y": 2760, "text": "Home header: settings entry point", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3660}, "n1": {"x": 2980, "y": 0, "w": 360, "text": "Behaviour\n• The whole row is the tap target (64px); the switch is a native checkbox with role=switch.\n• Each change saves instantly; no save button.\n• On failure the switch flips back and the error sits under that row (role=alert) with Try again.\n• Group counts and the bodyweight hint update as switches change.\n• New items append to a group; new groups append to the list (grid on desktop)."}, "t4": {"x": 0, "y": 3680, "text": "Weights as sets: list, add a set, edit a range set, edit a picked set (phone)", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3940}, "t5": {"x": 0, "y": 5000, "text": "Weights as sets (desktop)", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 10800}, "n2": {"x": 4060, "y": 3980, "w": 400, "text": "Weight sets\n• Each weighted item holds a list of sets. A set is a Range (start, step, top) or Picked weights, with an optional name.\n• The item's weights are the union of its sets; a weight in two sets counts once. Summary row on the equipment list: \"2–24 kg + 26, 28, 30 kg\".\n• Add a set: choose Range or Pick weights, optional name, Continue opens the edit screen.\n• A set can switch type; Range → Pick keeps its weights so one can be tapped off.\n• Steppers: Up to can never go below Start at (its minus disables). Step choices 0.5, 1, 2, 2.5, 4, 5 kg.\n• Remove this set: no confirm needed if undo is offered in a toast; otherwise confirm.\n• Everything saves as you go; a failed save reverts and shows the inline row error."}}, "designSystems": [{"title": "Rebound", "namespace": "rebound", "artifact": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/b1121b33-8e57-4476-86f5-747dddd6dea0", "version": null, "copiedAt": "2026-11-05T21:57:06Z"}]}